cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Building-Level Activity Capacity Pipeline — Rule-Based Classification"
abstract: >
  A transferable, open-source pipeline that derives building-level activity types
  and geometry-based potentials by combining ALKIS 3D cadastral data, OpenStreetMap,
  and a deterministic, tag-based classifier (no external API, no free-text name
  matching). Zone-level activity totals are redistributed to individual buildings
  using activity-informed, geometry-aware weights.
